                                                "sense_id": "a48c8430-1879-3b04-885f-43848a6b15f9",
                                                "text": "Featheredging is a process in preparing the photographs for mosaicking and involves cutting, tearing, and sandpapering the back of the print along its edges in such a way that the edge of the print is thin and will make a smooth match with adjoining prints."
